WEBVTT

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:26.210
Saint Seiya

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:33.530
The Underworld.

00:01:34.090 --> 00:01:37.190
The land of the dead, ruled by Hades.

00:01:37.850 --> 00:01:45.290
Young warriors of hope have entered
the Underworld in the name of peace.

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:48.440
Yes indeed.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:03.010
I'm sorry, Lord Hades.

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:08.880
I unintentionally did a horrible thing.

00:02:11.070 --> 00:02:17.690
I didn't think you would be
hiding in Orphée's chest.

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:21.920
I unknowingly thrust my spear into it.

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:25.310
I am relieved you were only scratched.

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:30.280
I can't imagine what I would
do if I had killed you.

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:34.570
Are these wounds from protecting Pegasus?

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:37.510
You are too kind.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:45.500
My heart is at ease, Lord Hades.

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:52.360
My beloved brother.

00:02:56.360 --> 00:03:04.290
A Ferocious Battle! The Road to Giudecca

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:17.860
Shun, Athena.

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:20.000
Everyone.

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:36.110
Hey, Hyoga. Get a hold of yourself, Hyoga.

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:42.660
Good, you're conscious now.

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:44.650
Where are we?

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:49.400
It seems we crossed the
Dark Swamp on this raft.

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:51.410
How?

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:58.010
We were defeated by the guardian
Specter of the Fourth Prison.

00:03:58.160 --> 00:04:00.590
We must have been saved by Canon.

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:05.950
Right, by Canon. And where is Canon?

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:10.050
He must have gone ahead
while we were unconscious.

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:13.810
What's that?

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:16.160
This must be the Fifth Prison.

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:19.470
The dead are burning inside their graves.

00:04:19.720 --> 00:04:25.250
The sinners in Underworld can't
even rest in peace in their graves.

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:34.840
What a forsaken place.

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:37.430
Let's get out of here and catch up to Canon.

00:04:37.430 --> 00:04:38.050
Right.

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:50.140
Canon!

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:52.850
He's already started the next fight.

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:58.390
I thought you two were
dead. I guess I was wrong.

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:00.840
Watch out!

00:05:01.720 --> 00:05:04.470
Calm down. It's already over.

00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:15.490
Canon.

00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:19.600
We're sorry for being a burden.

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:24.300
There's no time for apologies.
The next one's coming.

00:05:24.770 --> 00:05:25.590
What?

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:27.510
What's that?

00:05:31.070 --> 00:05:32.600
Rhadamanthys.
Rhadamanthys.

00:05:34.780 --> 00:05:38.960
One of the Big Three again.

00:05:38.960 --> 00:05:42.580
Perfect, my skills were
being wasted on these pawns.

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:47.470
I guess you are desperate to be with Pegasus.

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:48.150
What?

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:49.990
What do you mean?

00:05:50.090 --> 00:05:52.090
Did you kill Seiya?

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:54.600
That's right, I did.

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:58.100
Now Seiya is in the Ice Hell of Cocytus.

00:05:58.770 --> 00:06:03.530
The place where Gods send those who rebel.

00:06:04.570 --> 00:06:09.230
A place well suited for Saints
who rebel against Lord Hades.

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:10.930
No way.

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:12.200
Seiya!

00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:13.750
Stay focused.

00:06:14.190 --> 00:06:19.070
If you have time to mourn your friend,
defeat the enemy in front of you.

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:22.090
Don't forget what you're here to do.

00:06:23.740 --> 00:06:25.180
What's so funny?

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:30.990
What is this business about the Saints
who will protect the world with Athena?

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:34.860
You don't even know you've
been betrayed by your friend.

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:37.580
Betrayed? By our friend?

00:06:37.650 --> 00:06:41.590
Yes, by your friend, Andromeda.

00:06:41.850 --> 00:06:46.750
Who was actually Lord Hades,
ruler of the Underworld.

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:48.120
What?

00:06:49.110 --> 00:06:50.710
Shun was...

00:06:50.710 --> 00:06:51.530
Hades?

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:54.400
Nonsense. What do you mean?

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:57.060
I'm not obliged to explain everything.

00:06:57.490 --> 00:07:00.760
Especially to mice like
you that scurry around.

00:07:00.930 --> 00:07:05.830
I'll send all of you to the Ice
Hell of Cocytus just like Pegasus!

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:11.190
You two go ahead.

00:07:11.510 --> 00:07:14.620
I'm going to take him on.

00:07:15.480 --> 00:07:17.670
Right, Rhadamanthys?

00:07:18.140 --> 00:07:20.970
Fine. As you wish, Canon.

00:07:20.970 --> 00:07:21.890
But...

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:22.570
Canon...

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:26.420
I told you to not forget
what you're here to do.

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:28.040
Hurry and go.

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:29.830
All right.

00:07:30.710 --> 00:07:32.180
We're counting on you, Canon!

00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:38.720
Canon, I heard you killed all my
men in the Black Hurricane Valley.

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:42.150
I'm going to get you back for that!

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:43.290
Come.

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:55.070
Take this! Greatest Caution!

00:08:00.770 --> 00:08:01.740
What?

00:08:02.650 --> 00:08:06.220
You didn't know? Then I'll tell you.

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:10.760
The same attack doesn't
work on a Saint twice!

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:13.640
What's this?

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:17.100
Galaxian Explosion!

00:08:32.310 --> 00:08:34.600
How is it that my body feels so heavy?

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:39.760
Is my wound from Orphée's
Stringer Fine acting up now?

00:08:41.480 --> 00:08:42.640
Or...

00:08:42.920 --> 00:08:44.770
Is it because of that brat's attack?

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:50.080
It's over.

00:08:51.820 --> 00:08:53.840
What's wrong, Rhadamanthys?

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:55.580
You don't look so well.

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:58.510
Should we lend you a hand?

00:08:58.680 --> 00:08:59.730
What?

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:02.060
You two!

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:04.420
Minos. Aiacos.

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:09.110
I'm grateful for the Big
Three gathering in one place.

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:12.580
Now I can destroy all of you at once.

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:17.560
Do you intend to take on
the three of us alone?

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:22.070
Fine, we'll teach you how foolish you are.

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:28.390
Wait!

00:09:29.030 --> 00:09:32.060
Galactica Illusion!

00:09:43.530 --> 00:09:46.320
Rhadamanthys, why did you interrupt?

00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:51.440
If you didn't, Canon would
have been dead by that blow.

00:09:52.060 --> 00:09:56.720
Yes. He wouldn't have suffered as much.

00:10:00.340 --> 00:10:01.860
What is this?

00:10:03.210 --> 00:10:06.430
My body is starting to float.

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:16.840
It's like my body is manipulated
by invisible strings.

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:30.370
Yes, you have become my puppet.

00:10:30.710 --> 00:10:34.520
Even your fingers will move at my will.

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:37.980
You can't control a thing.

00:10:38.420 --> 00:10:39.980
What did you say?

00:10:41.310 --> 00:10:42.950
My fingers...

00:10:43.260 --> 00:10:45.950
Let's start with one finger.

00:10:50.650 --> 00:10:52.420
Now dance.

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:57.920
Yes, this is Griffin Minos' dance to death.

00:10:58.210 --> 00:11:00.390
Cosmic Marionation!

00:11:07.170 --> 00:11:13.520
My invisible strings make
your body writhe in pain.

00:11:15.850 --> 00:11:19.080
No point in torturing just
your fingers and limbs.

00:11:19.080 --> 00:11:22.820
Shall I move on and break your neck?

00:11:33.340 --> 00:11:37.650
Wait, Minos. Canon is my
opponent. Don't interfere!

00:11:38.990 --> 00:11:45.140
If it wasn't for us, you would
have been killed by him by now.

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:46.090
What?

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:49.170
Besides, it's over.

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:56.020
Enough! I'll finish Canon!

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:01.910
What's going on?

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:12.390
What was that? What happened?

00:12:12.610 --> 00:12:13.850
What's that?

00:12:17.940 --> 00:12:18.770
What is it?

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:21.170
That is a Cosmo!

00:12:21.270 --> 00:12:24.910
Yes. The Cosmo is burning like an aura.

00:12:35.530 --> 00:12:37.140
This Cosmo.

00:12:37.800 --> 00:12:42.890
What was that intense Cosmo
I felt all of a sudden?

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:48.310
It's different than the Cosmo of the
Saints who have entered the Underworld.

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:53.140
And it's such an aggressive Cosmo.

00:12:55.420 --> 00:13:00.390
Could it be him?

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:09.320
Phoenix.

00:13:09.670 --> 00:13:11.350
Phoenix Ikki!

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:24.390
Do you need some help, Canon?

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:30.700
Though you are no man to ask for help.

00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:35.520
However, Ikki, there's something
bigger going on here.

00:13:36.190 --> 00:13:41.680
Your brother, Andromeda Shun, is Hades.

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:44.420
What? Shun is Hades?

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:53.070
Nonsense. Shun has been with me since birth.

00:13:53.980 --> 00:13:56.350
How can he be Hades?

00:13:57.460 --> 00:13:59.860
So you are Lord Hades' brother.

00:14:00.740 --> 00:14:02.520
Then rest assured.

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:07.410
Lord Hades is being watched over by
Pandora in the Cocytus of Giudecca.

00:14:08.870 --> 00:14:10.000
Did you say Pandora?

00:14:11.930 --> 00:14:14.730
Could Pandora be that girl from that time?

00:14:29.490 --> 00:14:33.070
Shun, we're safe now.

00:14:33.070 --> 00:14:35.790
I will never let you go.

00:14:35.790 --> 00:14:37.170
You're wasting your time.

00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:42.030
Do you think you can escape me?

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:47.940
Now, hand him over to me.

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:53.900
Who are you? And why are
you trying to kidnap Shun?

00:14:54.140 --> 00:14:56.370
He is my brother.

00:14:57.240 --> 00:14:58.900
Nonsense.

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:05.220
Shun is my brother from the same mother.

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:07.340
He is not your brother.

00:15:07.850 --> 00:15:09.800
You must not know,

00:15:10.210 --> 00:15:16.120
but he was born into the flesh by God's fate.

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:19.380
His body does not belong to you.

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:23.620
Now, he must become one with this spirit.

00:15:24.390 --> 00:15:26.560
What's inside there?

00:15:30.410 --> 00:15:31.510
The universe!

00:15:46.490 --> 00:15:47.210
What?

00:15:47.520 --> 00:15:49.340
What is going on?

00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:58.400
I didn't see or think about her since then.

00:15:58.900 --> 00:16:04.700
I can't believe Shun was in her
hands after all these years.

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:09.620
So was that Universe?

00:16:12.500 --> 00:16:15.720
Even so, why Shun?

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:19.280
Why does it have to be Shun's body?

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:22.180
And why did Shun willingly change?

00:16:23.030 --> 00:16:25.170
You said your name was Phoenix.

00:16:25.930 --> 00:16:31.130
Even if you are Lord Hades'
brother, you are also a Saint.

00:16:31.400 --> 00:16:34.900
In other words, you are our enemy.

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:38.640
In which case, you shall die like Canon!

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:41.030
Why Shun?

00:16:48.140 --> 00:16:50.380
What are you doing, Ikki? Behind you!

00:16:52.640 --> 00:16:53.560
Ikki!

00:16:54.020 --> 00:16:55.060
Shun.

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:04.150
Ikki!

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:09.410
Pathetic.

00:17:09.530 --> 00:17:11.880
So that's a Bronze Saint.

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:22.060
You bastard.

00:17:29.530 --> 00:17:30.670
Ikki.

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:34.310
I see. I understand.

00:17:34.460 --> 00:17:35.760
I get it.

00:17:40.050 --> 00:17:41.940
Shun is ready to die.

00:17:42.350 --> 00:17:44.430
He is that kind of guy.

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:46.970
Why are you crying?

00:17:47.810 --> 00:17:50.900
You are weak to cry right now.

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:15.710
Decide who's first.

00:18:16.620 --> 00:18:17.520
What?

00:18:18.430 --> 00:18:23.370
Decide the order of who will die first.

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:24.980
Ikki.

00:18:25.880 --> 00:18:31.210
Shun, you were always worried
about my recklessness.

00:18:35.640 --> 00:18:38.260
Even when I decided to
go to Death Queen Island.

00:18:39.710 --> 00:18:42.200
And even when I came back a Saint.

00:18:43.760 --> 00:18:45.050
And now what?

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:49.980
You are the one who is being reckless.

00:18:51.920 --> 00:18:53.190
I'll get you back.

00:18:53.710 --> 00:19:00.570
With the wings of the Phoenix,
I will get my brother Shun back.

00:19:03.150 --> 00:19:05.030
Now, who am I fighting?

00:19:05.490 --> 00:19:08.730
Fine, I will be your opponent, as you wish.

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:12.670
I, Garuda Aiacos.

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:16.460
You must have lost your mind
after losing your mask.

00:19:17.190 --> 00:19:17.920
Here I come!

00:19:22.570 --> 00:19:23.440
Too slow.

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:33.920
No! I can't keep up with his speed.

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:41.500
Garuda Flap!

00:19:54.940 --> 00:19:59.630
What? He was blown so
far away he disappeared.

00:20:02.820 --> 00:20:06.150
In three seconds, he will land here.

00:20:06.500 --> 00:20:08.560
This is Phoenix's grave.

00:20:08.840 --> 00:20:09.760
What?

00:20:35.680 --> 00:20:40.800
You're still breathing. You're as
tough as your name indicates, Phoenix.

00:20:41.810 --> 00:20:44.100
Then take it again!

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:46.610
Garuda Flap!

00:20:47.570 --> 00:20:48.550
Ikki!

00:20:51.910 --> 00:20:56.980
In three seconds, he will
die here for sure this time.

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:08.510
What?

00:21:09.010 --> 00:21:11.700
Impossible! Why doesn't he land?

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:16.710
Did he grow wings and fly away?

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:18.590
Watch out, Aiacos!

00:21:25.560 --> 00:21:29.630
That marks your dying place.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:32.960
The same attack doesn't
work twice on a Saint.

00:21:33.630 --> 00:21:35.800
That's common knowledge by now.

00:21:36.750 --> 00:21:38.690
Now, who's next?

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:43.900
Do you think you've defeated Aiacos?

00:21:44.510 --> 00:21:45.460
What?

00:21:46.880 --> 00:21:49.570
The battle for the young warriors who entered

00:21:49.570 --> 00:21:50.900
the Underworld escalates.

00:21:51.490 --> 00:21:55.540
They are about to come face
to face with their destiny.

00:21:56.960 --> 00:22:00.180
Phoenix Ikki faces off against the Big Three.

00:22:01.610 --> 00:22:04.970
Andromeda Shun becomes Hades.

00:22:06.790 --> 00:22:12.040
Off to the Sixth Prison is
Cygnus Hyoga and Dragon Shiryu.

00:22:12.450 --> 00:22:13.600
And...

00:22:13.870 --> 00:22:15.640
What will happen to Pegasus Seiya?

00:22:20.220 --> 00:22:21.880
Athena.

00:22:23.870 --> 00:22:25.610
Sister.
